<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has intensified airstrikes and artillery shelling against Hezbollah missile and production facilities in Lebanon, including the Bekaa Valley, and has demolished homes in southern Lebanon. Hezbollah is facing legal pressure as Lebanese authorities have charged five members with recruiting and arming others, and sanctions have been placed on a Lebanese charity and gold companies for supporting the group. Iraq reached a compromise with a powerful pro-Iran militia to prevent a clash, according to officials. The conflict caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOeUFnTlFvemVwVno0eU5NcHhyM2YyRzRmbTJSQ3N6X1pzV2g2UmhtWmd1WXFqN18wVnZOSi1tRjZieU9hT016cGZkaWtwOGpFZzRCTFVxVjNOc2xnMjlGYndjYW1QdW9mNjJ3eVpTdndwakJ5OG9RQUdYTzhLVTU1RFkzdHZTcnlMN0cxa1lLdVMtb0xMcDg1dzdrQWx5cURGc250SGFEZEFnM2hL?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNNXBPbGlGWE90LXE0QkE1SDNyNVhid29TYU0xN01veEk2RzZqcUJ2OVFkN2dHQ1B5cnlGQlNadURjR1podG1iTjhFY1FOLTB1dE9sSHhNd1JUZ0VIQ1ZjVjV0Q2RXSllnMmw2cDhYSUZ5eTM4Nk9BU3JZLWdGNGJzX2dSOHFxcFZ0ZV9FUU5Qd1RKbkpMTThFNGc2NlJmdkpLR2ZyMHZMakdkWi1MTWh1UXNqaDlLcklhNE4yRzBZRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;United News of Bangladesh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE5QODJreG9PdGljUEZiTmFUOFRPX2FkajVPNXNTeUdtZTh4TC1tNURFN0pUU25DYV93QnVrQ3VuNXZvRmFZY2ppZERYTGVwSjRBMG5fM1RrVm5yVUZITUFwN2paN0RoaFB4S1JtU2tuYnRTUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ticker News&lt;